// Count of kept pairs whose winning labeled hamming appears at least twice.
// When none are shared, that count is not a kept one.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hmany ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hmany rank

IMPULSE hmany 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hmany" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
